From: PinePhone firmware
Subject: [PATCH] opengles: static quad for the branch-free programs

Each textured draw rewrote the vertex buffer for its texture coordinates; the
buffer is still in use by the GPU, so Mesa (lima) allocates a new buffer object
for every draw. The fill and texture programs now draw one static quad
(glDrawArrays, no 32 bit index buffer) and take the texture area as a uniform,
and look up their uniform locations once. CPU time of screen transitions
51 -> 45% of a core.
---
--- a/src/drivers/opengles/lv_opengles_driver.c
+++ b/src/drivers/opengles/lv_opengles_driver.c
@@ -56,7 +56,14 @@
